'Z ZERO: TOP OF THE SPOILBOARD {touch plate on the board}
'XY ZERO: the front-left corner of the 12 x 12 in board.
'NATIVECAM SPOILBOARD SURFACING: 12 x 12 in, 1 pass of 0.02 in {0.02 in in all} with 1-1/4in
'Surfacing Bit, 21 lines along X 0.6 in apart, both ways.
'BED CLEAR: remove every clamp. Every screw head and T-nut must sit at least 0.125 in below the cut.
'Set the dust shoe high enough for the surfacing bit's collet and the 0.5 in clearance.
'Re-zero Z on the board before every run: each run takes 0.02 in off the surface it is zeroed on.
'Runs about 2 min.
'NativeCAM spoilboard surfacing
'Post: ShopBot OpenSBP - NativeCAM 0.1
'Created: 2027-01-15 08:00
'Material: Spoilboard X12.0000 Y12.0000 Z0.7500 in
'Z zero: Material top  XY zero: Lower left
'T8 1-1/4in Surfacing Bit
IF %(25)=1 THEN GOTO UNIT_ERROR
SA
JS,13.333,6.667
'Load T8 1-1/4in Surfacing Bit and zero Z before starting
TR,12000
C6
PAUSE 3.00
'Surface spoilboard T8
JZ,0.5000
J2,-0.7500,0.0000
MS,0.333,0.333
MZ,-0.0200
MS,2.500,0.333
M2,12.7500,0.0000
M2,12.7500,0.6000
M2,-0.7500,0.6000
M2,-0.7500,1.2000
M2,12.7500,1.2000
M2,12.7500,1.8000
M2,-0.7500,1.8000
M2,-0.7500,2.4000
M2,12.7500,2.4000
M2,12.7500,3.0000
M2,-0.7500,3.0000
M2,-0.7500,3.6000
M2,12.7500,3.6000
M2,12.7500,4.2000
M2,-0.7500,4.2000
M2,-0.7500,4.8000
M2,12.7500,4.8000
M2,12.7500,5.4000
M2,-0.7500,5.4000
M2,-0.7500,6.0000
M2,12.7500,6.0000
M2,12.7500,6.6000
M2,-0.7500,6.6000
M2,-0.7500,7.2000
M2,12.7500,7.2000
M2,12.7500,7.8000
M2,-0.7500,7.8000
M2,-0.7500,8.4000
M2,12.7500,8.4000
M2,12.7500,9.0000
M2,-0.7500,9.0000
M2,-0.7500,9.6000
M2,12.7500,9.6000
M2,12.7500,10.2000
M2,-0.7500,10.2000
M2,-0.7500,10.8000
M2,12.7500,10.8000
M2,12.7500,11.4000
M2,-0.7500,11.4000
M2,-0.7500,12.0000
M2,12.7500,12.0000
JZ,0.5000
JZ,1.0000
J2,0.0000,0.0000
C7
END

UNIT_ERROR:
'This file is in inches; set ShopBot to inches and run it again.
PAUSE
END
